  "notes": "Backlog game, picked from RAWG's most-added list for its year (docs/PLAN.md section 2 ordering). StrategyWiki redirects \"Assassin's Creed Unity\" to \"Assassin's Creed: Unity\", a stub (completion stage 0, marked as a stub) with only a short Table of Contents subpage; nothing used. assassinscreed.fandom.com redirects to \"Assassin's Creed: Unity\" and answers the API, with about 474 linked pages; names only were looked at, nothing copied. None of the 57 Steam achievements is hidden. The last seven (51 to 57) form a Dead Kings block, which RAWG also lists as a separate entry (\"Assassin's Creed: Unity - Dead Kings\"); \"Piece of Eden\" (Memory Sequence 13), \"Reign of Terror\" (Guillotine Gun) and \"Freedom Fighter\" (Raider leaders) do not name Dead Kings and were placed there by schema position. \"No Man's Land\" (Rift missions), \"Needs More Data\" and \"Thawed\" (trapped Assassins) were put with Paris activities; what kind of missions these are is not stated in the data."
